<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 100,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 100,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa/southern Minnesota hog receipts Thursday matched the estimate of 100,000 head. Opening trade not well established. Early sales Barrows and Gilts $0.50 per cwt lower compared to midsession Thursday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    57.50 -59.00	   58.50 -60.00</p>
<p>few			57.00  59.50	   58.00  60.50</p>
<p>few early		60.00		    61.00</p>
<p>Sows:  steady to $1.00 higher.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  46.00 -48.00	   47.00 -49.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   47.00 -49.00	   48.00 -49.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    50.00 -53.00	   50.00 -55.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
